                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.00/3871: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Cuba</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-09-14T19:00:00-04:00">September 14, 1933—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>100. Your telegram 249, September 14. I talked this afternoon with the French
                    Ambassador regarding this matter, and have also telegraphed the Embassy at Paris
                    to take it up immediately with the Foreign Office.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
